# EnvProxy line-ending policy: the repository stores LF everywhere.
# Current tree is LF-only (including *.cmd and UTF-8-BOM envproxy.ps1) and works
# on Windows as-is, so no per-platform exceptions. Git preserves the BOM bytes
# of envproxy.ps1; editors must save it as UTF-8 WITH BOM, and envproxy.sh as
# LF without BOM (a BOM breaks its shebang). See README sections 10 and 12.6.
* text=auto eol=lf
